      "created": 1790818313130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3D Gallery Module",
      "fontSize": 31,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3D Gallery Module",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xzoVkmJS8CNjP1IVFD1Vz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 494.19852707904954,
      "y": 3007.5011482876657,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 143.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 983505745,
      "version": 605,
      "versionNonce": 5468031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790819378914,
      "created": 1790818629886,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The module's job is to give the viewer and artist an interactive way\n(zooming and clicking) to explore a scene of the artist's artworks. It\nretrieves and stores the artworks into the relational database\nallowing it to appear in the scene after an artist upload it in the\nupload module.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The module's job is to give the viewer and artist an interactive way (zooming and clicking) to explore a scene of the artist's artworks. It retrieves and stores the artworks into the relational database allowing it to appear in the scene after an artist upload it in the upload module.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cKMlK6hA93EdfGGmSXT_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 495.1402494039661,
      "y": 3218.2154340019524,
      "width": 303.8308410644531,
      "height": 38.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zqkbiqj0ZTdrAoC855KLc"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b12V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2117983793,
      "version": 440,
      "versionNonce": 139929503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790819378914,
      "created": 1790818330100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2D Overview Module",
      "fontSize": 31,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2D Overview Module",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gHZ-4R3jr4nMvKURVPuf7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 502.7699556504782,
      "y": 3290.358291144809,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 172.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zqkbiqj0ZTdrAoC855KLc"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b13",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 247885041,
      "version": 665,
      "versionNonce": 594467775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790819378914,
      "created": 1790818848365,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The module's job provides an overview of all artworks in the 3D gallery\nand any additional artworks the artist did not include in the 3D\ngallery. It gives viewers a choice of how they want to interact with\nthe website whether that is just either the 3D gallery or the 2D\noverview or both. It stores the artworks that display here in the\nrelational database for retrieval.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The module's job provides an overview of all artworks in the 3D gallery and any additional artworks the artist did not include in the 3D gallery. It gives viewers a choice of how they want to interact with the website whether that is just either the 3D gallery or the 2D overview or both. It stores the artworks that display here in the relational database for retrieval.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "94VYSmPQD4NlsW6qI6ir0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 496.0575892738742,
      "y": 3799.6440054305235,
      "width": 236.28187561035156,
      "height": 38.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
