      "updated": 1790819378914,
      "created": 1790819179511,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The module's job allows the artist to upload the artworks and the\n.procreate file with the canvas information so that they can be stored\nand retrieved for later. It is where the artworks and canvas\ninformation are paired together so that they are able to be displayed\ntogether in the 3D Gallery and the 2D Overview.",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The module's job allows the artist to upload the artworks and the .procreate file with the canvas information so that they can be stored and retrieved for later. It is where the artworks and canvas information are paired together so that they are able to be displayed together in the 3D Gallery and the 2D Overview.",
